rfc7617 example: QWxhZGRpbjpvcGVuIHNlc2FtZQ==
no credentials     -> 401  challenge=Basic realm="iron"
ada ok             -> 200 hello ada on /data
ada wrong pw       -> 401  challenge=Basic realm="iron"
bob user page      -> 200 hello bob on /home
bob admin page     -> 403 admins only
ada admin page     -> 200 hello ada on /admin/users
eve empty pw       -> 200 hello eve on /x
unknown user       -> 401  challenge=Basic realm="iron"
colon in password  -> 401  challenge=Basic realm="iron"
granted=4 denied=4 forbidden=1
